NOTE ON LICENSING SCOPE

This MIT license covers the *code* in this repository (the generation pipeline:
install.sh, run_one.sh, generate.py, duration_cap.py, cuda_loader_path.sh).

It does NOT cover the model weights or the base model, which are licensed
separately and are NON-COMMERCIAL:

  - The ArabMaqamRock LoRA and the Quran pronunciation LoRA are derivatives of
    YuE2 and are released under CC-BY-NC-4.0.
  - The YuE2 base model / GGUF is CC-BY-NC-4.0 (m-a-p/YuE2-3B,
    audio-cpp/Yue2-3B-GGUF).

See MODEL_CARD.md for details.
